{
  "Npcs.FetishZealot.Desc": "The [if (shotaZealot) {young }][zealotSkin]-skinned zealot is [if (shotaZealot) {[if (metric) {less than a meter and a half|about four and a half feet}]|[if (metric) {about a quarter short of two meters|a few inches short of six feet}]}] and clad in long dark-blue robes with a white trim on the edges. His [zealotHair] hair is neatly groomed, and while the whole ensemble is clearly ceremonial in some way, the debauchery is made evident as the robe opens up to frame his at least normal-seeming [if (shotaZealot) {little|human}] cock."
  "Npcs.FetishZealot.Desc.Default": "The zealot has a seemingly-impossible appearance. After thinking about it for a few moments, you conclude that what he most resembles is a bug of some sort."
  "Npcs.FetishZealot.Desc.Leather": "The zealot is now encased in a full-body suit of leather, concealing most of his [zealotSkin] flesh, with a cock case over his crotch that sports a very large zipper."
  "Npcs.FetishZealot.Desc.Students": "The zealot seems to be dressed like a young academic; of course, this is no less perverse an outfit than before, sporting a bare midriff and functionless short-shorts that expose his [if (shotaZealot) {tiny }]cock."
  "Npcs.FetishZealot.Name": "fetish zealot"
}
